{"id":"n69267-1-5","stage":4,"title":"요란 · 吵闹","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69267-1-5-1","ko":"뭘 그렇게 시끄럽게 요란을 떨고 있니?","zh":"你干嘛搞得这么吵闹啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"시끄럽게","meaning":"吵闹，喧嚣","explanation":"시끄럽다：吵闹，喧嚣；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"시끄럽다","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15961","senseId":"1","lemma":"시끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시끄럽게","audio":"/audio/b2f29421ce3f1461bfe3.mp3"}},{"text":"요란을","meaning":"吵闹，嘈杂，闹哄","explanation":"요란：吵闹，嘈杂，闹哄；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"요란","audio":"/audio/b7875b32d8b75be754dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69267","senseId":"1","lemma":"요란","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요란을","audio":"/audio/c0451fc6d67c630e482d.mp3"}},{"text":"떨고","meaning":"耍","explanation":"떨다：耍；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"떨다","audio":"/audio/c05578fd2da67674b9a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65529","senseId":"6","lemma":"떨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨고","audio":"/audio/6bd89fa71c3c983e743c.mp3"}},{"text":"있니?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있니","audio":"/audio/5cc802647eea2944ec84.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"72d1507eed9433fb","term":"시끄럽다","zh":"吵闹，喧嚣","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3","entryId":"15961","definition":"声音大而嘈杂，令人听起来厌烦。","pronunciation":["시끄럽따"]},{"id":"b7875b32d8b75be7","term":"요란","zh":"吵闹，嘈杂，闹哄","audio":"/audio/b7875b32d8b75be754dc.mp3","entryId":"69267","definition":"乱糟糟闹哄哄的。","pronunciation":["요란"]},{"id":"c05578fd2da67674","term":"떨다","zh":"耍","audio":"/audio/c05578fd2da67674b9a9.mp3","entryId":"65529","definition":"总是轻浮而不小心地做某种行动。","pronunciation":["떨ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a27c8357adbd14b24ec2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69267-1-5-2","ko":"벌레가 나왔어요!","zh":"有虫子出来了！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벌레가","meaning":"虫子","explanation":"벌레：虫子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"벌레","audio":"/audio/ee023753239e5ca14bd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59098","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌레","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌레가","audio":"/audio/efdac885a1a663284ccb.mp3"}},{"text":"나왔어요!","meaning":"出，长出","explanation":"나오다：出，长出；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"2","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나왔어요","audio":"/audio/9c894cf2b8ccb1afceae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ee023753239e5ca1","term":"벌레","zh":"虫子","audio":"/audio/ee023753239e5ca14bd3.mp3","entryId":"59098","definition":"昆虫或寄生虫等身体结构简单的动物。","pronunciation":["벌레"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出，长出","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"从里面冒到外面。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea4d64c541817ed819ea.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.09,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69267","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你干嘛搞得这么吵闹啊？","有虫子出来了！","你真的那么喜欢智秀吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你干嘛搞得这么吵闹啊？","有虫子出来了！","你真的那么喜欢智秀吗？"],"answer":1}]}
